1. Key Changes Needed
Check Document Context First:

Use the vector store to search for relevant documents.

If a relevant document is found, return the answer from the document.

If no relevant document is found, fall back to OpenAI.

Integrate RetrievalQA:

Use the RetrievalQA chain to query the vector store.

Improve Prompting:

Ensure the system understands when to use the document context and when to use OpenAI.

2. Updated /generate Endpoint
Here’s how you can modify the /generate endpoint to prioritize document context:

